### Negative findings summary

Neomorph is an experimental OpenCode Zen model with no published benchmark data, no lab attribution, and no community evaluations. Its small context window (64K in / 4K out) and lack of any performance data make it impossible to score. The model has zero presence on benchmark leaderboards or independent evaluation platforms.

